1) Unless otherwise stated, after the duration of any spell above, the material returns to its natural state. For example, water boiled with the Boil Water spell will begin to cool after the duration of the spell.
2) Unless specifically stated, all of the spells on this list apply to any liquid (not just water).
3) Some sample boiling temperatures for various liquids (see Section 7.1.13). MYSTIC BASE 4.7.4 LIQUID ALTERATION
